OL,3,GNEWSATeenager reaches national
OL,4,Abeatboxing finals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old beatboxer has reached the
OL,7,Ffinal of the UK's national under-18
OL,8,Fbeatboxing championships after
OL,9,Fimpressing judges with a video
OL,10,Faudition.
OL,12,FSonny, from Devon, who is known by his
OL,13,Fstage name SonnyT, will compete against
OL,14,Fsix other finalists at the championship
OL,15,Fin Bristol in October.
OL,17,FBeatboxing, which involves using the
OL,18,Fmouth, lips, tongue and voice to create
OL,19,Fdrum beats and sound effects, has been
OL,20,Fa passion for Sonny since primary
OL,21,Fschool.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
